  "findings": [
    "StartBuild acceptance is IN_PROGRESS, not command success. The successful real S3-source build preserved pre_build shell exports, honored start environment override over project/buildspec, read owned source bytes and emitted CloudWatch logs.",
    "exit7 failed BUILD with COMMAND_EXECUTION_ERROR; finally and POST_BUILD ran, UPLOAD_ARTIFACTS succeeded and its actual S3 ZIP bytes were consumed.",
    "StopBuild during BUILD returned STOPPED/buildComplete true/currentPhase COMPLETED in this capture; BUILD phase STOPPED. No cancellation completion marker appeared in captured logs.",
    "The five-minute timeout returned overall FAILED with BUILD phase TIMED_OUT/statusCode BUILD_TIMED_OUT after304.066s. This is a configuration-specific native observation, not proof that modeled overall TIMED_OUT is unused elsewhere.",
    "A missing BatchDeleteBuilds ID is returned as a full ARN in buildsDeleted with no failures. Missing StartBuild/StopBuild returns ResourceNotFoundException400; missing batch reads return not-found collections.",
    "Duplicate CreateProject returns ResourceAlreadyExistsException400. UpdateProject timeout4 fails InvalidInputException400 (native message allows5minutes through36hours), leaving timeout5 unchanged.",
    "StartBuild overrides leave project configuration unchanged; snapshot records are retained.",
    "S3 artifact still existed after BatchDeleteBuilds and was independently removed during cleanup."
  ],
